# ============================================================
# 基于 .gitignore.example，额外忽略采集器所需的本地身份文件。
#
# 注意：logs/ 下最终导出的 AI Coding 日志必须提交，不要忽略！
# ============================================================

# Build artifacts
build/
out/
*.o
*.a
# ...but the imported Armino baseline needs its generated config headers and
# the six closed archives on the baseline link line (T19, chips/bk7258/
# armino_baseline/PROVENANCE.md).
!chips/bk7258/armino_baseline/build/
!chips/bk7258/armino_baseline/build/**
!chips/bk7258/armino_baseline/cp/components/bk_libs/bk7258/libs/*.a
*.elf
*.hex
*.map
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
/bk_loader
# bk_loader writes a Windows-style relative log path, so on Linux it lands as a
# literal backslash filename next to the tool, root-owned when run under sudo.
*bk_loader_COM*.log
AGENTS.md
research/
/investigation/
compile_commands.json
.mimocode/
.env

# vendor/ = symlink scaffolding that plugs the contest chip/board layers into
# the openvela build (vendor/beken/chips/bk7258 -> chips/bk7258, etc.).
# Local-only build glue, never committed.
vendor/

# .claude/skills/contest-log-redact/ = 本地脱敏脚本，含密钥分片，严禁入仓。
# 整目录忽略（SKILL.md 也含本机绝对路径与本地密钥文件位置，且无脚本即不可用）。
.claude/skills/contest-log-redact/
